AI_HORDE_KEY	Your AI Horde key, or anonymous key for testing
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME	Your Cloudinary cloud name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY	Your Cloudinary API key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET	Your Cloudinary API secret
IG_USER_ID	Your Instagram professional account ID
IG_ACCESS_TOKEN	Your Instagram publishing token
GRAPH_VERSION	A currently supported Graph API version
JOB_SECRET	A long, random secret string
